  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Estonian School of Dipl/ Partnerskaps Prgrm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Estonian School of Dipl/ Partnerskaps Prgrm</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att, genom en serie seminarier, analyserar styrkor och svagheter i &#xd6;stliga partnerskapsl&#xe4;ndernas system f&#xf6;r EU-koordingering. Genom detta utarbetas huvuddragen i hur en framg&#xe5;ngsrik och effektiv EU-koordinering b&#xf6;r se ut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to, through a series of seminars and a conference, to analyze strengths and weaknesses of the Eastern Partnership countries&apos; EU coordinatino systems. Thereby a basis for how a succesful and effective EU-coordination should look like is formed.</narrative>
  </description>
